  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "ce17ef95-001c-56d8-bf58-edc3f2f1f862",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "34229d52-6980-0680-8beb-5417fafd8073",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Supervised by a skilled therapist, the M.A. Jinnah Road clinic provides comprehensive, state-of-the-art physiotherapy and rehabilitation services for orthopaedic, neurological and paediatric conditions. In addition to its on-site physiotherapy facilities on Stadium Road, AKUH has also been offering Home-Based Physiotherapy Services for the last four years. This cost-effective, time-saving and relatively risk-free facility brings physiotherapy services to patients' doorsteps, enhancing independent function in the context of home and community living.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "\"The long-term plan is to introduce a multidisciplinary rehabilitation approach with state-of-the-art therapeutic modalities and techniques at the Physiotherapy Clinic at M.A. Jinnah Road,\" said Nasrullah Shaikh, Manager Physiotherapy Services, AKUH.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
