    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Building on an outreach programme that aims to provide accessible, compassionate and high-quality care to patients all over Karachi, Aga Khan University Hospital (AKUH) is now offering off-site physiotherapy and rehabilitation services in the heart of the old city. The new clinic, which opened last month, is part of the Hospital's Integrated Medical Services (IMS) unit on M.A. Jinnah Road and follows the successful launch of similar services at Clifton Medical Services and Aga Khan Diagnostic and Surgery Centre in Karimabad.",
